====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Whitehall'' is the 39117<sup>th</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 563 individuals. ''Whitehall'' is most common among White (66.43%) and Black/African American (21.14%) individuals.

